Package: oorealpath
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libc6
Description: CANONICAL PATH
 Resolves all symlinks, relative components, and canonicalizes absolute path roots.
 Capability-bounded openOODA utility with zero ambient authority,
 oote theme palettes, and native Model Context Protocol (MCP) surface.
